DESCRIPTION<<DESC_END
WSL #328 validator: bring TAP IFF_UP after TUNSETIFF so test_tap_smoke can TX (Linux write() is EIO while down); default TAP name fltap%d so it does not collide with macvlan fl0; skip linux-modules-extra on Microsoft WSL kernels (package is not in Ubuntu apt); install iptables/nftables when missing; find powershell.exe under /mnt/c/Windows when PATH is root-only; document expected hwsim/physical-ota/uart-hw SKIPs on WSL without USB Wi-Fi or ESP32.
DESC_END

RELEASE_DATE=2026-08-12
